#~ "arrangement. One to three are typical for "
#~ "a diffusion couple; use five or more "
#~ "only to study within-layer disorder."

#~ msgid "**层内成分不等于目标小数。** 原子数是整数，每层按最接近的整数计数分配。增大超胞或减少 `bins` 可以提高每层成分分辨率。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A bin fraction does not exactly equal "
#~ "the requested decimal.** Atom counts are "
#~ "integers and use the nearest feasible "
#~ "allocation. Increase the supercell or reduce "
