#~ msgid ""
#~ "`分箱数`（`bins`）越大，成分变化看起来越细，但每层原子越少、整数取整误差越大。某层有 `N` "
#~ "个候选原子时，单个元素能够表达的最小成分步长约为 `1/N`。例如每层只有 4 个原子，只能稳定表达 "
#~ "0%、25%、50%、75% 和 100%。如果输入只有 32 个候选原子，设 8 "
#~ "层已经意味着每层约 4 个原子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Larger `bins` make the composition change "
#~ "appear finer, but leave fewer atoms per "
#~ "layer and increase integer-rounding error. "
#~ "With `N` candidate atoms in a layer, the"
#~ " smallest fraction step for one element is"
#~ " about `1/N`. A layer with four atoms "
#~ "can stably express only 0%, 25%, 50%, "
#~ "75%, and 100%; with 32 candidates, eight "
#~ "bins already means about four atoms per "
#~ "layer."

